OCPROJECT 1
# ZERO C#. This project directory contains no .cs file at all -- verify with `find . -name '*.cs'`
# and expect nothing back. Everything it does is in Content/Scripts/*.ocgraph.
#
# It exists to prove the claim the engine now makes: that Aver Node works out of the box, the way
# Blueprints does, without a project first writing a C# class to give it something to stand on. Three
# graphs: a game mode that starts the play session, a character driven by polled input, and a target
# that counts events fired at it by another graph.
NAME AN_Playable
ENGINE Aver 0.1.2
CREATEDWITH 0.2.0
CONTENT Content
STARTMAP Maps/Range.ocmap
